    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "APP Kirrane Auctioneering are delighted to present this splendid two bedroom ground floor apartment to the market. This property offers spacious living and sleeping accommodation. A delightful patio area overlooking the River Moy and private parking space. The property is accessed via a key coded front door. \nLocated close to the world famous Foxford Wollen Mills, a vairety of amenities and service providers, ample locations for fishing, scenic walks and historical buildings. Only a short drive to Ballina, Casltebar, Ireland West Airport, Knock Shrine, Lough Key Forest Walks, to mention just a few. An ideal location for first time buyers, retirees, holiday home or an investment property.\n\nAccommodation consists of entrance hallway, open plan kitchen come dining and living area fitted with ample worktop and storage space. Overlooking the River Moy. Timber flooring with tiled floor in the kitchen area. Electric fire and electric heating fitted throughout. Large tiled bathroom, fitted with white bathroom ware. Two double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and timber flooring. \n\nThe property is nicely presented and offers an even flow throughout. For further information or to arrange viewing please contact the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering where everything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nPlease Note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy themselves by viewing the property or employ somebody to inspect the property on their behalf. No Auctioneer or Staff Member employed by APP Kirrane Auctioneering in either; Main Street, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo or Bohermore, Galway has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.\n\n"
      },
